            </note>
            <note corresp="#d578-f3" n="3" xml:id="d578-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed; it reported a preliminary discussion with De la Tournelle on the
                    question of consultations with the Germans (396.1/1–2451).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
